# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in to turn on Google sync.
#
# An OAuth 2.0 **Web application** client ID from the Google Cloud console.
# It is public by design — it names the application, it does not authorise
# anything — so it is safe in a build, in a CI variable, and in page source.
# There is no client secret: the browser flow does not use one.
#
# Leave it unset and the sync button does not appear at all. Everything is
# kept in the browser, exactly as it was before sync existed.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
